  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Giả sử hai véc-tơ  hợp với nhau một góc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msup><mn>100</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>,  véc-tơ thứ ba vuông góc với mặt phẳng tạo bởi hai lực đã cho là  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>. Dựng hình hộp <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (như hình vẽ).  Khi đó, tổng hợp lực là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>80</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/b725faa23a58b033c5f516ce792737c1a8e5eb93b3c75ee866d4a9a716dac130.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>80</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>664</mn></mrow></semantics></math>,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>8</mn></semantics></math>.\n\t\tSuy ra, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></semantics></math>,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>8</mn></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tVì tam giác <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn>